			<div class="content" id="post-content-1856968">
									

<p>Thanks to all who looked at this for me! I’ve always wanted to make a skip chase the Foundation, and by happy coincidence, I found that the best way to do that would be to have it take place in a time where they weren’t as big and powerful. Here, they are <em>just</em> starting to get big.</p>
<p>All of these pictures originated from the visual records, Agatha (SCP-1913-1) from artifacts, Telly (SCP-1913-2) from humanoids, and Freddie (SCP-1913-3) from animals.</p>
<p>Anyway, I hope you all enjoy! <span style="color: white">ЖωЖ</span></p>

